{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":15890853,"ns":0,"title":"Bateman transform","extract":"In the mathematical study of partial differential equations, the Bateman transform is a method for solving the Laplace equation in four dimensions and wave equation in three by using a line integral of a holomorphic function in three complex variables.  It is named after the mathematician Harry Bateman, who first published the result in (Bateman 1904).","description":"Method for solving the Laplace equation in four dimensions","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}